    "type": "question",
    "label": "73",
    "prompt": "Let $A$ be a subset of $\\mathbb R$. Define the following.\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\max A&=x\\in A\\text{ where }x\\ge a\\text{ for any }a\\in A\\\\\\min A&=x\\in A\\text{ where }x\\le a\\text{ for any }a\\in A\\end{aligned}$$\nFind $\\min[-5,7]$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$-5$",
      "worked": "The closed interval includes $-5$, and every member is at least $-5$. Thus $\\min[-5,7]=-5$.",
